  "title": "Azure Storage for AI workloads​",
  "description": "Learn how Azure Storage powers AI inference at scale. This session explores how to securely bring enterprise data to AI models, accelerate AI workloads with high-performance storage, and reduce GPU idle time through faster model loading and optimized data access. See how Azure Storage integrates with Microsoft and open-source AI frameworks to improve performance, lower costs, and enable scalable agent-based applications.",
